  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>I</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mtext>dx</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mtext>&#8704;x</mtext><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is the constant of integration) and&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given integral is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br />Let <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
  }
